[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_5B_ELECMAG]
Electromagnetic Catapult

[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_5B_ELECMAG_desc]
Please set your hoof phone to flight mode and do not carry any metal decorations, otherwise you may fly out with the shell. Maybe the electromagnetic catapult doesn’t work like this, but it’s always better to be careful.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_5B_ELECMAG]
电磁弹射

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_5B_ELECMAG_desc]
请将你的蹄机调整为飞行模式，并且不要携带任何金属装饰，否则你可能会和炮弹一起飞出去。也许电磁弹射不是这样工作的，但是总还是小心为好。
